Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(restore): recover 1,073 files that commit 10fd070
 replaced with NUL bytes

Commit 10fd070 (integrate final update bundle / social login / TOTP MFA)
replaced 1,073 tracked files with the same number of NUL bytes, keeping every
file's exact byte length. The tree stayed structurally valid, so git fsck is
clean and git status shows nothing modified; the damage was only visible when a
file was read.

Consequence: tests/TestCase.php was 11,141 NUL bytes, so the whole PHPUnit
suite died with 'Class Tests\\TestCase not found' and could not run a single
test. 207 Blade templates and 88 front-end sources were equally dead, along
with 31 lang files, the Rust weekly-result-integrity crate and the CI scripts.

Every affected path is restored byte-for-byte from dd7a0a4, the commit
immediately before the corruption.

